            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.24

- Fixed the last word of a wide or wrapping lyric line getting clipped at the right edge when it became the active line. The active line's subtle grow-on-focus now has room to breathe (the lyrics column reserves a right margin, like Apple Music), so nothing is cut off.
]]></description>
