            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.23

- The full-screen open/close zoom is now an album-colored box, like Apple Music: the window grows out of the overlay tinted with the artwork's color (and shrinks back into it on close) instead of a plain black box. The color matches the full-screen backdrop, so the content fades in seamlessly.
]]></description>
